{"articleNo":"94453","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=94453&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014 핀란드 정부초청 장학생 선발요강 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.11.06","hit":"3608","attachments":[{"name":"2.Finnish Government Scholarship Pool.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94453&attachNo=73237"},{"name":"3.지원서A (국립국제교육원 소정양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94453&attachNo=73313"},{"name":"3. 지원서B 29295 Form Scholarship Pool 2014-2015.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94453&attachNo=73325"},{"name":"4.2013 (외국정부초청지원자) 핀란드 DB.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94453&attachNo=73349"},{"name":"1. 2014 핀란드 정부초청장학생 선발요강.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94453&attachNo=73447"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">핀란드 정부에서는 2014 핀란드정부초청 박사과정 장학생을 아래와 같이 모집하고 있습니다. 관심있는 학생들의 많은 지원 바랍니다. </span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2014 핀란드 정부초청 장학생 선발요강</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">1. 선발 인원 및 장학금 지급기간</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1) 주관: 핀란드 국제교류센터</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(Center for International Mobility, CIMO) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) 인원: ○명 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(3) 장학금 지급 기간 : </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">3개월-9개월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> (2014. 9.-)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 국립국제교육원에서는 10명 이내 선발, 핀란드정부에 추천</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 핀란드정부는 전세계 지원자를 대상으로 최종 선발.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2. 장학금 지급내역</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1) 생활비 : 매월 1,200유로 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) 숙소(기숙사)는 지급되는 장학금으로 본인이 해결해야 함. </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(3) 항공료?의료보험료 본인 부담(출국전 보험 가입 필수) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">3. 지원 자격</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1) 대한민국 국적자, 건강?병역 등 해외유학에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) 석사학위 이상 소지자 - 2014. 2월 취득예정자 포함 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(3) 핀란드 소재 대학원 또는 고등교육/연구기관으로부터 다음 자격으로 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">초청장 혹은, 추천을 받은 자 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 대학원 박사과정 입학생(우선 선발)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 연구생 혹은, 대학 강사로 초청을 받은 경우</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(4) 대학원 수학/연구 수행에 충분한 언어능력을 입증할 수 있는 자 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(5) 수학?연구 종료 후 귀국하여 국내에서 활동할 수 있는 자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※장학금 기간이 시작되는 시점을 기준으로 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">핀란드 대학원/연구</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">기관에 1년 이상체류한 경력이 있으면 지원할 수 없음</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">4. 선발 절차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> 제출된 파일을 심사하여</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1) 1차:본원(초청장, TOEFL, IELTS점수, 석사과정 G.P.A.) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">→ </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">추천자 발표</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) 합격자 원본 서류 제출 -&gt; 핀란드정부에 추천</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) 2차:핀란드 CIMO(별도 기준에 의함), 2014년 6-7월 최종 확정</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">5. 제출 서류 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1)응시원서A (본원 소정양식-한글) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) Application B(CIMO 소정양식-영문) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※CIMO 홈페이지에서 다운받아 사용, </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">입력 후 출력, 서명해야 함.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(3) 이력서(영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(4)학위증 사본 또는, 석사학위 취득(예정)증명서(영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(5) 학부 및 석사과정 전과정 성적증명서(영문 - G.P.A. 기재)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(6) 지도교수 2명의 추천서(영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(7) 수학/연구계획서(2-5쪽, 영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(8) 핀란드의 대학, 고등교육?연구기관, 지도교수 등의 초청장 사본</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(9) TOEFL, IELTS SCORE REPORT 사본(2012.09.01이후 성적만 유효)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(10) 핀란드어, 스웨덴어 증명서(해당자에 한함) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(11) 여권사본</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(12) 본원 DB (증명사진 포함) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">※제출 서류는 스캔된 압축 파일로 제출</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※위 서류 중 (1), (12)를 제외한 나머지 서류는 영문 혹은 핀란드어</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">로 작성 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※(10)은 해당 언어 구사자만 제출 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">6. 지원마감일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2014. 1. 21(화) 16:00</span></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">까지 본원 필착</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">7. 제출처 및 제출 방법: 첨부1 참조</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">8. 선발 일정</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1) 지원 마감일 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2014. 1. 21(화) 16:00</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) 1차 합격자 발표 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2014. 1. 24(금) 16:00</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(3) 1차 합격자 원본 서류 제출: </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2014. 2. 5(수) 16:00</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">-제출서류 목록 1~11 순서대로 원본 1부 구성, </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">1부 복사하여 2부 제출.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">9. 기타</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(1) 지원서에 허위 기재를 한 사실이 발견될 경우, 추후라도 합격을 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">취소함. </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(2) 직장인 및 병역미필자는 합격했을 경우 유학이 가능한지의 여부를 사전에 개별적으로 확인한 후 지원할 것(인사, 병역 등의 문제는 지원자 책임임. 특히 공무원은 합격한 후 유학휴직 등이 가능한지의 여부를 지원서 제출 전에 인사권자-기관장에게 확인하기 바람) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(3) 기타 사항</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 423pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 138pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 핀란드 대학 학기는 9월부터 5월까지임.</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. CIMO에서 지원하는 대학원(박사)과정 대부분의 강의는 영어로 진행됨.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. CIMO에서 지원하는 장학금은 최대 9개월이며, 이후 자비로 학업을 계속해야 함. </span></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. CIMO의 장학생 선발은 대학원 박사 과정 선발과 별개이므로 먼저 박사과정 입학 허</span></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가를 받아야 함.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. 핀란드 장학금 관련 참고 자료 </span></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(1) CIMO (The Centre for International Mobility)</span></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 전화; (</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">+358) 20-690-501 (문의 사항 질의)</span></u></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(2) 주한 핀란드 대사관 ☎ 02-732-6737 ex) 204</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1- 2014 핀란드정부초청장학생선발요강 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1-1 Finnish Government Scholarship Pool 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 2-지원서A (국립국제교육원 소정양식) 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 3-지원서B 29295_Form_scholarship_pool_2014-2015 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 4-2013(외국정부초청지원자)-핀란드DB 1부. 끝.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\"> </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"></p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
